/*
 * LPUART3 overlay for FRDM-iMX93 M33 core.
 *
 * Note: we intentionally do NOT declare the LPUART3 node here. The
 * Zephyr LPUART driver leaves the FIFO with TXOF/RXUF error flags and
 * the STAT register with PF/FE/NF/OR RX error flags set, which keeps
 * RDRF stuck at 0 and prevents external loopback from succeeding.
 *
 * main.cpp drives LPUART3 entirely via the baremetal MCUXpresso SDK
 * (LPUART_Init / LPUART_ReadByte / LPUART_WriteBlocking), matching
 * what the standalone hello_lpuart3 does — that path passes loopback
 * at 1 Mbaud cleanly.
 *
 * LPUART3 base for M33 non-secure view = 0x42570000
 * IRQ = 68 (NVIC, ARMv8-M)
 * Clock root = Lpuart3, sourced from Osc24M with div=1
 * Pinmux: GPIO_IO14 -> LPUART3_TX, GPIO_IO15 -> LPUART3_RX
 *
 * Two-pin mode with external short (TX ↔ RX) on GPIO_14/GPIO_15.
 */